{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engage in an epic clash and dominate the cubic battleground!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube1 vs Cube2 is a fast-paced local multiplayer action game where two (or up to four!) players face off in chaotic duels using a massive arsenal of weapons across wild, gimmick-filled arenas. Jump, dash, shoot, and outsmart your opponents in high-stakes battles where every move counts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 21 maps in 9 different worlds, each one with its own gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > +30 weapons to master</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A skin store with +20 outfits to customize your cubes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Local Multiplayer: Up to 2-4 players by connecting gamepads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Controls</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827510/extras/28bce5386af835b31d93af7825f41b1e.avif?t=1752377770\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827510/extras_big/28bce5386af835b31d93af7825f41b1e.avif?t=1752377770 width=800 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to enter the arena and engage in challenging one-on-one battles? Join the fray and showcase your skills in this addictive cube game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3827510?t=1752377770","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827510/56162c5d979b8bb906d354d62ba9d814ec007f24/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752377770","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3827510/8c88765c1dae7098a87cf9e6848c0189699f9536/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=175237